      <p source="#source-778-1080"><seg source="#source-778-796">参上仕候よし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-796-865"><rb><seg source="#source-799-802">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-802-814">二</note><seg source="#source-814-820">仰聞</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-820-832">一</note></rb><rt>（おほせきかされ）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-865-907">候。然ニ私方にも唯今長府馬関</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-916-973"><seg source="#source-907-916">在番其</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-943-958">赤馬関奉行</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-973-1000">余両人計参居申候。</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-1000-1078"><seg source="#source-1018-1051">但シ昨夜出崎仕候由也。</seg></seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1080-1190"><seg source="#source-1080-1098">商会に取組の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1098-1143"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-24" source="#source-1098-1125">ヿ</g></rb><rt>（こと）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1143-1190">共次第此度は取定度との事なり。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1190-1300"><seg source="#source-1190-1211">何か御かまい無</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1211-1223">レ</note><seg source="#source-1223-1300">之事なれバ、御手書たまハり度、先上件申上候。謹言。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1300-1362" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-1321-1362"><seg source="#source-1321-1327">則報</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1327-1362" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(1)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=1"><seg source="#source-1357-1362">龍</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-1362-1403"><seg source="#source-1362-1377">佐々木先生</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1377-1403" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1395-1403">楳拝</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1403-1430" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
